adaptation]] was later produced by [[Netflix]].\r\n\r\nSet in a vast ocean world governed by the elusive World Government. The series follows [[Monkey D. Luffy]] and the crew of the [[Straw Hat Pirates]] in search for the titular \"One Piece\", a treasure said to contain a world-changing power.\r\n\r\nThe series has a spinoff called [[Shokugeki no Sanji]], itself an off-shoot of [[Shokugeki no Souma]].\r\n\r\nh4. Entries\r\n\r\nh6. Main\r\n\r\n* [[one piece: The Movie|The Movie]]\r\n* [[one piece: clockwork island adventure|Clockwork Island Adventure]]\r\n* [[one piece: dead end adventure|Dead End Adventure]]\r\n* [[one piece: the cursed holy sword|The Cursed Holy Sword]]\r\n* [[one piece: baron omatsuri and the secret island|Baron Omatsuri and the Secret Island]]\r\n* [[one piece: the giant mechanical soldier of karakuri castle|The Giant Mechanical Soldier of Karakuri Castle]]\r\n* [[one piece: strong world|Strong World]]\r\n* [[one piece film: z|Film Z]]\r\n* [[one piece film: gold|Film Gold]]\r\n* [[one piece: stampede|Stampede]]\r\n* [[one piece film: red|Film Red]]\r\n* [[One Piece Film: God Valley]]\r\n\r\nh6. Other\r\n\r\n* [[One Piece (Live Action)]]\r\n* [[One Piece Card Game]]\r\n* [[One Piece Dream Pointer]]\r\n* [[One Piece Everyday]]\r\n* [[One Piece Fan Letter]]\r\n* [[One Piece Heroines]]\r\n* [[One Piece Straw Hat Space]]\r\n* [[One Piece Treasure Cruise]]\r\n* [[Shokugeki no Sanji]]\r\n\r\nh4. Characters\r\n\r\n* [[Monkey D. Luffy|]]\r\n* [[Roronoa Zoro]]\r\n* [[Nami (one piece)|]]\r\n* [[Usopp]]\r\n* [[Sanji (one piece)|]]\r\n* [[Tony Tony Chopper]]\r\n* [[Nico Robin]]\r\n* [[Franky (one piece)|]]\r\n* [[Brook (one piece)|]]\r\n* [[Jinbe (one piece)|]]\r\n\r\nh4. Related tags\r\n\r\nh6. Organizations & Groups\r\n\r\n* [[Baroque Works]]\r\n* [[CP9]]\r\n* [[Eleven Supernova]]\r\n* [[Gorosei]]\r\n* [[Impel Down]]\r\n* [[Shichibukai]]\r\n* [[Whitebeard Pirates]]\r\n* [[Celestial Dragons (One Piece)|]]\r\n\r\nh6. Objects and Powers\r\n\r\n* [[Devil Fruit]]\r\n* [[Den Den Mushi]]\r\n* [[Haki (one piece)|]]\r\n* [[Log Pose]]\r\n\r\nh6. Locations\r\n\r\n* [[Enies Lobby]]\r\n* [[Impel Down]]\r\n* [[Marineford]]\r\n* [[Shabondi]]\r\n* [[Thriller Bark]]\r\n\r\nh6. Memes\r\n\r\n* [[Blackbeard writing (meme)]]\r\n* [[Chopper crying (meme)]]\r\n* [[Enel face (meme)]]\r\n* [[He laughed (meme)]]\r\n* [[I want to live (meme)]]\r\n* [[The One Piece is real (meme)]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [[List of One Piece characters]]\r\n\r\nh4. External links\r\n\r\n* \"Official Twitter\":https://twitter.com/OPcom_info/\r\n* \"Wikipedia: One Piece\":https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:8784","status":"source_backed"}],"matched_documents":[{"title":"one_piece","original":"A [[pirate costume|pirate]] adventure manga and anime series drawn by [[Oda Eiichirou]]. It started in 1997 and it is the best-selling manga of all time. An animated adaptation was produced by [[Toei Company]] and a [[one piece (live action)|live action adaptation]] was later produced by [[Netflix]].\r\n\r\nSet in a vast ocean world governed by the elusive World Government. The series follows [[Monkey D. Luffy]] and the crew of the [[Straw Hat Pirates]] in search for the titular \"One Piece\", a treasure said to contain a world-changing power.\r\n\r\nThe series has a spinoff called [[Shokugeki no Sanji]], itself an off-shoot of [[Shokugeki no Souma]].\r\n\r\nh4. Entries\r\n\r\nh6. Main\r\n\r\n* [[one piece: The Movie|The Movie]]\r\n* [[one piece: clockwork island adventure|Clockwork Island Adventure]]\r\n* [[one piece: dead end adventure|Dead End Adventure]]\r\n* [[one piece: the cursed holy sword|The Cursed Holy Sword]]\r\n* [[one piece: baron omatsuri and the secret island|Baron Omatsuri and the Secret Island]]\r\n* [[one piece: the giant mechanica