\r\nHappygun\r\nIslewan\r\n[[Jinbe (one piece)|]]\r\nJulius\r\nKarma\r\nKechatch\r\nKinga\r\nLittle Oars Jr.\r\nMcGuy\r\nNinth\r\nNosgari\r\n[[Palms (one piece)|]]\r\nPavlik\r\nRamba\r\nReforte\r\nRush\r\nSleepy\r\n[[Squardo]]\r\nVitan\r\nWallem\r\n[[Whitey Bay]]\r\nZodia\r\nZucca\r\n\r\n[b]Others:[/b]\r\nChameleone (non-canon)\r\n[[Marshall D. Teach]] (defected)\r\n[[Moby Dick (One Piece)|]] (flagship)\r\n[[Stefan (one piece)|]] (pet)","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:44077"}],"aliases":[],"identity_evidence":[{"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:44077","status":"source_backed","type":"page","locator":null}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"matched_by":"fts","source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:44077","citations":[{"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:44077"}],"score":-18.93167437213189},{"entry_key":{"kind":"page","namespace":"danbooru.wiki","value":"51789"},"locator":null,"descriptions":[{"title":"donquixote_family","original":"An organisation in [[One Piece]]. Led by [[Donquixote Doflamingo]], the Donquixote Family (also known as the Donquixote Pirates) are a powerful group in the underground, supplying weapons and ruling Dressrosa with an iron fist.\r\n\r\nThey are mainly organized into groups named after the card suits. Doflamingo had intended for [[Trafalgar Law]] to take on the role of Corazon (heart), but Law had other plans.\r\n\r\n[b]Commando Unit:[/b]\r\n\r\n* Leader: [[Pica (one piece)|]] (Spade)\r\n* [[Gladius (One Piece)|Gladius]]\r\n* [[Buffalo (One Piece)|Buffalo]]\r\n* [[Baby 5]]\r\n\r\n[b]Fighting Unit:[/b]\r\n\r\n* Leader: [[Diamante (one piece)|]] (Diamond)\r\n* [[Lao G (one Piece)|]]\r\n* [[Machvise]]\r\n* [[Senor Pink]]\r\n* [[dellinger_(one_piece)|Dellinger]]\r\n\r\n[b]Special Powers Unit:[/b]\r\n\r\n* Leader: [[Trebol (one piece)|]] (Club)\r\n* [[Sugar (One Piece)|Sugar]]\r\n* [[Giolla]]\r\n* [[Viola (one Piece)|Violet]]\r\n\r\n[b]Others or members belonging to unknown units:[/b]\r\n* [[Donquixote Rocinante]] (deceased)\r\n* [[Vergo (one piece)|]]\r\n* [[Monet (One Piece)|Monet]]\r\n* [[Caesar Clown]]\r\n* [[Bellamy (one piece)|]]","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:45667","status":"source_backed"}],"matched_documents":[{"title":"donquixote_family","original":"An organisation in [[One Piece]]. Led by [[Donquixote Doflamingo]], the Donquixote Family (also known as the Donquixote Pirates) are a powerful group in the underground, supplying weapons and ruling Dressrosa with an iron fist.\r\n\r\nThey are mainly organized into groups named after the card suits. Doflamingo had intended for [[Trafalgar Law]] to take on the role of Corazon (heart), but Law had other plans.\r\n\r\n[b]Commando Unit:[/b]\r\n\r\n* Leader: [[Pica (one piece)|]] (Spade)\r\n* [[Gladius (One Piece)|Gladius]]\r\n* [[Buffalo (One Piece)|Buffalo]]\r\n* [[Baby 5]]\r\n\r\n[b]Fighting Unit:[/b]\r\n\r\n* Leader: [[Diamante (one piece)|]] (Diamond)\r\n* [[Lao G (one Piece)|]]\r\n* [[Machvise]]\r\n* [[Senor Pink]]\r\n* [[dellinger_(one_piece)|Dellinger]]\r\n\r\n[b]Special Powers Unit:[/b]\r\n\r\n* Leader: [[Trebol (one piece)|]] (Club)\r\n* [[Sugar (One Piece)|Sugar]]\r\n* [[Giolla]]\r\n* [[Viola (one Piece)|Violet]]\r\n\r\n[b]Others or members belonging to unknown uni